5497005,"node_id":"U_kgDOBbErLQ","login":"devloglogan","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/devloglogan"},"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100283#pullrequestreview-2532562861","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/100283","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","submitted_at":"2025-01-06T16:53:49Z"},{"id":2554654792,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6YRPBI","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?u=e44a465cbebabb9ea2be80b59e6dc07966bef5b7&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","login":"clayjohn","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn"},"body":"Overall this is extremely good! We have discussed a few fine points already and have agreed that:\r\n1. Doing the prepass is fine. Its unfortunate, but its a necessary complexity we agree to live with\r\n2. The shader code will need to have a spec constant or a separate variant (I think we need a variant anyway, so this is likely a non problem (because we need the multiview definition. So we can just check `#if defined(MULTIVIEW) && defined(MOTION_VECTORS)`)\r\n\r\nThe last thing before merging is doing performance testing on low end desktop devices and non-XR mobile devices. In the rendering meeting Bastiaan raised a concern (that I share) that this could have a negative impact on all scenes (not just when using MVs). So we should do careful testing before merging. \r\n\r\nAt this point though I suspect this is nearly ready to merge (once my new comment is addressed) and could be merged right after 4.4 is released.","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100283#pullrequestreview-2554654792","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/100283","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-01-16T03:52:03Z"},{"id":2559223693,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6YiqeN","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/95497005?u=adfee76e7d1bd361d1802deb354ae2aab3007582&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/devloglogan","id":95497005,"node_id":"U_kgDOBbErLQ","login":"devloglogan","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/devloglogan"},"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100283#pullrequestreview-2559223693","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/100283","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","submitted_at":"2025-01-17T14:54:49Z"},{"id":2771379737,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6lL-YZ","state":"APPROVED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1945449?u=96b5dc9be2859dca5f31314c87d99a68a21e1576&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/BastiaanOlij","id":1945449,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDU0NDk=","login":"BastiaanOlij","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij"},"body":"I'm happy to approve this.\r\n\r\nMy only nitpick is that we currently enable motion vectors based on the overrule being set. Thats good enough for now but I suspect there may be more logic wanted here in due time.\r\n\r\nOther than that, from what I can see reading through the code, looks like we captured all the things we discussed before.","html_url":"http